\[x^2 + (4x^2 - f)^2 = (4x^2 - d)^2.\]Expanding, we get
\[x^2 + 16x^4 - 8fx^2 + f^2 = 16x^4 - 8dx^2 + d^2.\]Matching coefficients, we get
\begin{align*}
1 - 8f &= -8d, \\
f^2 &= d^2.
